2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T12:29:08-07:00","id":1246725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1130275-it-s-coming?p=1246721#post1246721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not just them, but yeah.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Well, actually, that would be ignoring a central point to the CHronicles design-yeah, they probably contributed, but a lot of the worst things to have happened have happened for much the same reason they did in the real world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Worst things ? Your a comrade to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T16:51:07-07:00","id":1246809,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1130275-it-s-coming?p=1246725#post1246725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Worst things ? Your a comrade to?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe ArcaneArts specifically is referring to one of the core conceits of Chronicles of Darkness being that most of the broad strokes of human history happened for the same reason they did in the real world, i.e. without supernatural intervention. The grand conspiracies of the old World of Darkness aren't really part of Chronicles' design (weeeell, unless you're a Voice of an Angel fan). So there's generally an aversion to attributing something as huge as the rise of Capitalism to a supernatural creature like the Mesen-Nebu, although they almost certainly aided and hitched their wagons to that wave.<br /> <br /> Although I do very much suspect you wouldn't be the only one on these boards with a healthy dose of skepticism towards Capitalist philosophy, for that matter <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I couldn't possibly speak for Arc on that though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T22:01:10-07:00","id":1246874,"title":"","content":"To be fair, the Guilds were mortal insitutions at the height of their importance, albeit with some guidance from the Shan'iatu when the latter wanted something from them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"re