le-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Most of the changes are pretty minor, so I doubt we'll have a What Has Changed section. We'll leave that for the manuscript to inform people.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am incredibly ready and excited to see the MtC 2e manuscript on KS ! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T10:15:59-07:00","id":1342114,"title":"","content":"Sugarcube?....????","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T11:30:20-07:00","id":1342136,"title":"","content":"So the new Onyx Path KS account finished the Scarred Lands Creature Collection KS a few days ago. I'd love to hear estimates/thoughts on when the MtC2e KS will start up. My hope/best guess would be an Oct 30/31 start to the KS.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T15:44:14-07:00","id":1342201,"title":"","content":"Some notes from today's Pathcast:<ul><li>The Wadjet-Itja is one of the Minor Guilds, a (mostly) new addition in Second Edition rounding out Iremite society beyond the five guilds. Depending on interest, the minor guilds could potential get their own follow up book if the Mummy Kickstarter is very successful</li> <li>The Deceived are absolutely still around (and their book is still useful) but there is a lot more room to be explored around other guilds.</li> <li>Body Thieves, Blood Bathers, Eternals, and Reborn are the featured immortals from Immortals in Second Edition, in keeping with the immortality themes.</li> <li>Eternals are kinda like D&amp;D liches/Dorian Grey, with an object anchoring them and keeping them alive. But to a mummy, an object containing their lifeforce is a Relic filled with Sekhem that belongs to the Judges. So they can work together, but there will always be an undercurrent of possible betrayal.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T15:58:48-07:00","id":1342207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1130275-it-s-coming?p=1342114#post1342114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sugarcube?....????</div> </div> </div> </div>The comment reminded me of this, even though admittedly it's clearly a Promethean reference:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFHcLdAn4Ug\" data-code=\"pFHcLdAn4Ug\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pFHcLdAn4Ug/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T16:35:25-07:00","id":1342220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1130275-it-s-coming?p=1342201#post1342201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some notes from today's Pathcast:<ul><li>The Wadjet-Itja is one of the Minor Guilds, a (mostly) new addition in Second Edition rounding out Iremite society beyond the five guilds. Depending on interest, the minor guilds could potential get their own follow up book if the Mummy Kickstarter is very successful</li> <li>The Deceived are absolutely still around (and their book is still useful) but there is a lot more room to be explored around other guilds.</li> <li>Body Thieves, Blood Bathers, Eternals, and Reborn are the featured immortals from Immortals in Second Edition, in keeping with the immortality themes.</li> <li>Eternals are kinda like D&amp;D liches/Dorian Grey, with an object anchoring them and keeping them alive. But to a mummy, an object containing their lifeforce is a Relic filled with Sekhem that belongs to the Judges. So they can work together, but there will always be an undercurrent of possible betrayal.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the write up, very cool. Also interesting stuff here. <br /> <br /> On immortals, so not the Purified? I had hopes they would be in it. Their nature is fun.<br /> <br /> That said the Reborn are fascinating. What an interesting capability to return time and again. I bet due their physically normal nature they can learn mortal magics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 10-18-2019, 07:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}